// rustc : E0502 "cannot borrow `*v` as immutable because it is also borrowed as
//         mutable" (borrowck-lend-flow-loop.stderr @ da5114692c9, the SECOND of
//         its two errors — `**x += 1; borrow(&*v); … x = &mut v;`, which is this
